  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Generating Resilient Opportunities for Work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s main objective is to ensure that marginalized communities including women, men and persons with disabilities in the Northern Province of Sri Lanka, have access to inclusive, climate-resilient, and lasting decent work opportunities that improve their economic and social well-being.</narrative>
  </description>
